-
-    //--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-    //                                             THE DEFERRED SWEEP
-    //--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-
-    /// 🧩 Records every menu and tooltip deferred this tick, in the order they were declared.
-    /// note  🔴 Once per tick, after the last control. The sheet stacks its menu at z-20 and its tooltips at
